{
  "_meta": {
    "id": 90,
    "name": "dialog_loc_postalstation_postal_way_station",
    "description": "Dialogi przypisane do lokacji \"Postal Way Station\" (waa: postalstation).",
    "status": "done",
    "count": 25
  },
  "strings": {
    "Follow the map [Travel towards Breadwood]": {
      "pl": "Podążaj za mapą [Podróż w stronę Breadwood]",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.getinfo"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Go through them": {
      "pl": "Przejdź przez nie",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers1.unusednode",
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers2.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers3.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers4.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Go through them again": {
      "pl": "Przejdź przez nie jeszcze raz",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers3.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Hmm, there's a coupon in here that somehow miraculously hasn't expired yet.": {
      "pl": "Hmm, jest tu kupon, który jakoś cudem jeszcze nie wygasł.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers1.getcoupon"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Ignore it for now": {
      "pl": "Na razie zignoruj",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.getinfo"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Investigate the house": {
      "pl": "Zbadaj dom",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.follow"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It says \"Postal Service Property.  NO TRESPASSING.\"": {
      "pl": "Napis: „Własność Poczty. ZAKAZ WSTĘPU.”",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_door.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's a stack of old newspapers.": {
      "pl": "To stos starych gazet.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers1.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers2.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers3.popup",
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers4.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's addressed to Roy Bean.": {
      "pl": "Adresowane do Roy Bean.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers4.letter"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Maybe you could ask about it at the post office in Dirtwater.": {
      "pl": "Może zapytasz o to na poczcie w Dirtwater.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Nothing else interesting.": {
      "pl": "Nic więcej ciekawego.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers1.e",
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers4.e"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Nothing interesting this time.": {
      "pl": "Tym razem nic ciekawego.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers3.e2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Nothing interesting.  Oh, wait, there's actually a postcard in here that you could use.": {
      "pl": "Nic ciekawego. O, chwila, jest tu pocztówka, której możesz użyć.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers3.e"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Oh hey, there's an undelivered letter underneath the stack.": {
      "pl": "O, hej, pod stosem leży niedoręczony list.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers4.letter"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Oh hmm, there's an article in here about how they had to change the name of a nearby cemetery due to so many skeletons being raised there.  You mark down the cemetery's location on your map.": {
      "pl": "O, hmm, jest tu artykuł o tym, jak musieli zmienić nazwę pobliskiego cmentarza, bo podnoszono tam tyle szkieletów. Zaznaczasz lokalizację cmentarza na mapie.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers2.e"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Or maybe not": {
      "pl": "A może nie",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Somebody has removed all the funnies, so there is literally no reason to care about them.": {
      "pl": "Ktoś wyrwał wszystkie komiksy, więc dosłownie nie ma powodu, by się nimi przejmować.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers1.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "There's an article about how they had to change the name of Boot Hill Cemetery to Reboot Hill Cemetery because of all of the skeletons in there coming back to life.": {
      "pl": "Jest artykuł o tym, jak zmieniono Boot Hill Cemetery na Reboot Hill Cemetery, bo wszystkie szkielety ożywały.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers2.alreadysaw"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "There's nothing more of any use to you in this cabinet.": {
      "pl": "W tej szafce nie ma już nic przydatnego.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.nomore"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "This cabinet is full of maps, but you have no idea what any of them mean.": {
      "pl": "Szafka pełna map, których nie rozumiesz.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Trespass": {
      "pl": "Wtargnij",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_door.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Yeah, maybe": {
      "pl": "Ta, może",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You follow the map, and along the route to Breadwood you find a suspicious-looking house.": {
      "pl": "Podążasz za mapą i w drodze do Breadwood znajdujesz podejrzany dom.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.follow"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You look at the address and jot it down on your map.": {
      "pl": "Patrzysz na adres i zapisujesz go na mapie.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_papers4.letter"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You use the cheat sheet to find the route map that leads to Breadwood.": {
      "pl": "Używasz ściągi, żeby znaleźć mapę trasy do Breadwood.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.postalstation_cabinet.getinfo"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    }
  }
}
